cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or this code, please cite this repository and the corresponding publication(s) listed under references."
title: "Aerial Gas Tomography — Data and Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Field data and analysis code for aerial gas tomography: reconstruction of two-dimensional methane distributions from
  remote TDLAS measurements taken by a drone with a gimballed laser sensor. Raw data of the experiments carried out at
  BAM in 2016-2020, the original analysis code and a reproduction of the central results of four publications.
type: software
authors:
